{
  "_comment": [
    "Projects the editor can open cold, named in the fragment: /designer/#example=feed.",
    "They exist so a link can hand somebody a system to look at rather than an empty",
    "canvas. Each one is an ordinary design document, so it is edited, checked and",
    "downloaded exactly like something drawn by hand; nothing here is a special case",
    "once it is loaded.",
    "",
    "`feed` is the project the home page of synqt.org reads out file by file, so the",
    "diagram there and the canvas here are the same system. Keep them in step: the",
    "suite asserts the entities, the links and the contract members match the",
    "synqt.yaml and the .syn sources that page shows."
  ],
  "examples": {
    "feed": {
      "version": 1,
      "project": "my-app",
      "entities": [
        {"name": "app", "kind": "client", "targets": ["wasm"], "x": 40, "y": 40},
        {"name": "edge", "kind": "service", "capability": "web_edge", "x": 360, "y": 40},
        {"name": "store", "kind": "service", "blueprint": "relational",
         "provider": "sqlite", "x": 680, "y": 40},
        {"name": "feeds", "kind": "service", "blueprint": "api", "x": 680, "y": 200}
      ],
      "links": [
        {"name": "feed", "contract": "Feed", "owner": "edge", "consumers": ["app"],
         "instance": "per_session", "members": [
           {"kind": "prop", "name": "loaded", "type": "bool", "params": [], "roles": []},
           {"kind": "model", "name": "rows", "type": "", "params": [],
            "roles": [{"type": "int", "name": "id"}, {"type": "string", "name": "title"}]},
           {"kind": "slot", "name": "load", "type": "", "params": [], "roles": []},
           {"kind": "signal", "name": "denied", "type": "",
            "params": [{"type": "string", "name": "reason"}], "roles": []}
         ]},
        {"name": "access", "contract": "Access", "owner": "store", "consumers": ["edge"],
         "instance": "per_peer", "members": [
           {"kind": "slot", "name": "allows", "type": "bool",
            "params": [{"type": "string", "name": "sub"}], "roles": []}
         ]},
        {"name": "upstream", "contract": "Upstream", "owner": "feeds", "consumers": ["edge"],
         "instance": "per_peer", "members": [
           {"kind": "slot", "name": "fetch", "type": "var", "params": [], "roles": []}
         ]}
      ]
    }
  }
}
